FramedBlocks (Fabric)
=====================
A Fabric port of FramedBlocks for Minecraft 1.20.1.

This project is a port, not a rewrite. It is derived from the original
FramedBlocks mod created by XFactHD:

    Copyright (C) XFactHD

Original repository: https://github.com/XFactHD/FramedBlocks

Changes made in this port
-------------------------
The original codebase has been converted from the Forge modding platform to
the Fabric modding platform (Fabric Loom, Fabric API). This includes:

  - Replacing Forge registration and networking APIs with their Fabric
    equivalents.
  - Converting Forge capability, item, energy and fluid handlers to their
    Fabric counterparts (or to self-contained stubs where no Fabric
    equivalent exists).
  - Converting the Forge render pipeline hooks and block entity rendering
    to the Fabric rendering APIs (Indigo).
  - Adapting Forge event handling to the Fabric event system.
  - Fixing render-layer handling for camouflaged blocks so semi-transparent
    camouflages (e.g. grass block overlays) render in the correct layer
    instead of falling back to the solid layer.

